Even if such a refutation is completed, the strongest eligibility objection is that this may be merely correcting a weakly supported2026 numerical guess by standard quadrature/Diophantine bounds, rather than the substantive new analytic discovery required by this campaign. The companion remains unread in full, journal counterpart unlocated, complete current registry head unavailable and specialist prior art bounded. These objections must be resolved before any formalization investment. The easy false-pole clause, old convergence theorem, averaged identity, sign/normalization errors, exact finite checks, one rotation variant and all helpers earn zero credit.
